* From J. C. Shaw, "JOSS: A Designer's View of an Experimental On-Line Computing System", RAND P-2922, August 1964, figure 3i.
6.1 Type form 61.
6.2 Line.
6.3 Do part 7 for t=0(h)4.

7.1 Type t, a in form 62 if fp(t/.5)=0.
7.2 Do part 8 for x = t+h·(.5-k), t+h·(.5+k).

8.1 Set y = c·exp(-x*2/2).
8.2 Set a = a+.5·h·y.

Form 61:
  t      Integral
Form 62:
_.__     _.____

Set a=0.
Set k=1/sqrt(12).
Set h=.1.
Set c=1/sqrt(2·3.14159265).

Do part 6.
  t      Integral

 .00      .0000
 .50      .1915
